          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 6.1 binds us to exclusivity for the entire (automatically renewing) term with no exit if HDI underperforms, so we have limited it to twelve months from the Effective Date and made it fall away automatically if HDI misses the service level, availability or delivery dates it has promised. Our preferred position is no exclusivity on the Company at all, but we can live with this narrowed, performance-conditioned version given HDI bears the Site costs; HDI's reciprocal covenant in Section 6.3 is unchanged.",
